                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Linguist Deborah Tannen observes that the core of our society's approach to argument\nis our habit of seeing issues and ideas as absolute and irreconcilable principles continually at war...",
            "block_bbox": [
                121,
                373,
